<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Visionstream buy lifts Leighton shares.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Visionstream buy lifts Leighton shares.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in construction group Leighton Holdings Ltd were boosted after the company announced it had purchased the Visionstream unit of government-owned telecommunications carrier Telstra Corp, brokers said.</p>
<p>By 3.45 p.m. (0445 GMT), Leighton shares were 11 cents higher at A$5.42 in a weaker market.</p>
<p>Leighton said the purchase increased work in hand by about A$300 million.</p>
</text>
